<%!-- The welcome questions as a page (VutuvWeb.WelcomeController).

This is NOT where a new member meets them — the registration PIN lands on
their profile and floats the same form over it as a modal (see
VutuvWeb.WelcomeComponents.welcome_modal/1). The page is the frame for the two
requests the modal cannot answer itself: a **rejected** submit, which needs the
errors rendered somewhere, and a direct GET of the URL while the one-shot
window is still open. It reuses <.auth_layout> so it continues the look of the
sign-up and PIN screens. --%>
<.auth_layout
  title={welcome_title(@user)}
  subtitle={
    gettext(
      "Two questions before you start. They decide who finds you and which jobs we show you. Answer as much or as little as you like."
    )
  }
>
  <.welcome_form address_changeset={@address_changeset} user_changeset={@user_changeset} />
</.auth_layout>
